  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSE Project Burundi - Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Action International (HAI) has drawn on its international and national experience to devise an intervention that will become pivotal in changing the promotion, acceptance and use of modern FP in Burundi. Together with its implementing partner, it will gather actors from the public sector, private sector and civil society all who have an interest in the outcome of the FP market, in a national and sub-national multi-stakeholder engagement (MSE). We believe that we can influence FP demand. We will influence policy, change societies attitudes and support the supply chain for FP commodities.</narrative>
  </description>
